# FABLE-SONNET-NAME-SPECIALS-20260924-155 commit 2: the norm's negative
# witness. lm_own_new_zero has NO predef: here (deliberately) -- with the
# l2_is_known hard-coded adapter list gone, an adapter name with no predef
# declaration must be refused "unresolved name", not silently admitted.
# Mutant (the inverse): restoring the old hard-coded list turns this GREEN
# (l2trans wrongly accepts), which is exactly the regression this row pins.
fn: m () int
    if: lm_own_new_zero(4U) != 0
        return: 1
    return: 0
end: m
return: 0
